#. English: Another package manager is busy right now. Close it (or wait for it), then try again.
msgid "task_err_locked"
msgstr "Un autre gestionnaire de paquets est occupé. Fermez-le (ou attendez), puis réessayez."

#. English: Couldn't download it - check your internet connection and try again.
msgid "task_err_network"
msgstr "Téléchargement impossible – vérifiez votre connexion internet et réessayez."

#. English: No password window could be shown - your desktop has no polkit authentication agent running, so nothing was changed.
msgid "task_err_no_agent"
